    </p><a href="/">← Home</a><pagefind-searchbox></pagefind-searchbox><script type="module" src="/pagefind/pagefind-component-ui.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="/static/pagefind.js"></script><h1 class="instruction-section" data-pagefind-body="1" data-pagefind-weight="10" data-pagefind-sort="title">MOV (SIMD&amp;FP scalar, unpredicated)</h1><p class="insn_subtitle" data-pagefind-body="1">Move indexed element or SIMD&amp;FP scalar to vector (unpredicated)</p>
      <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">This instruction unconditionally broadcasts the SIMD&amp;FP scalar into each element of the
destination vector. This instruction is unpredicated.</p>
    <p>
        This is an alias of
        <a href="dup_z_zi.html">DUP (indexed)</a>.
        This means:
      </p><ul><li>
